{"id":"852e36a39d13964a","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity.md","title":"封闭数类型正规形必为数码","display":"thm-system-t-closed-canonicity — 封闭数类型正规形必为数码","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity","aliases":["72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity"],"display":"thm-system-t-closed-canonicity — 封闭数类型正规形必为数码","depends_on":["[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §4.2, print358/PDF370 and §4.3; explicit local canonicity proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-system-t-closed-canonicity — 封闭数类型正规形必为数码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97a98663b21af886\" href=\"?note=97a98663b21af886\" title=\"72-df-system-t-normal-form\">72-df-system-t-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §4.2, print358/PDF370 and §4.3; explicit local canonicity proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline0:=\\mathbf0\">\\(\\overline0:=\\mathbf0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n+1}:=\\mathsf S\\overline n\">\\(\\overline{n+1}:=\\mathsf S\\overline n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c\">\\(t\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c\\)</span>。正常项在所有子项处均无 β 或 recursor redex。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists u\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}\\ (\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\rho_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists!n\\in\\omega\\ (t=\\overline n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists u\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}\\ (\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\rho_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists!n\\in\\omega\\ (t=\\overline n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按正规项大小作强归纳，考察应用脊的头。封闭性排除变量头；λ 头要么使整个项为箭头型，要么形成 β redex。常元 0 给数码零；S 必须恰有一个数类型参数，归纳使该参数为数码。recursor 若仍未给足参数则结果是箭头型；给足的数参数是更小的封闭数类型正规项，归纳为零或后继，于是形成 recursor redex，矛盾。数码构造的单射性给唯一性。不能把封闭条件删掉，例如自由变量 x 本身就是非数码正规项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-system-t-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"97a98663b21af886","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\overline0:=\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{n+1}:=\\mathsf S\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists u\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}\\ (\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in\\rho_T)\n\\Longrightarrow\\exists!n\\in\\omega\\ (t=\\overline n).","display":true}],"bytes":1644,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"45a40cdcc24cf331","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-syste